--- !u!114 &114057250486858521
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1589598485070108}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 442
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 当时我也未曾放在心上。风雷谷作为门派要地，不仅有诸位长老的洞府，驻地还有金丹修士把持大局。但是直至现在，她都没有再与我联系过。于是前些时候，我将此事报告掌门，但她认为金丹修士十年五载地没有音信很正常，让我不要过于操心，应该多花些心思修炼。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
